<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>believe</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1">PRYVT</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">&amp;SCENE</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">0OCm0CwiM6B3OSbSMPJ58l</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:10.098" end="00:18.098">Cause darling, I just wanted to believe</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:30.736" end="00:33.999">Passing by like you're a stranger</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:33.999" end="00:38.044">A story that will never unfold</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:38.044" end="00:39.807">Time will heal</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:39.807" end="00:41.604">Time will seal</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:41.604" end="00:45.665">All our wounds up</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:45.665" end="00:49.434">Seasons change it's getting colder</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:49.434" end="00:57.434">With you I thought I'd found forever</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:15.785" end="01:22.305">Out of mind</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:22.305" end="01:25.820">You never were meant to stay</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:25.820" end="01:30.587">A passing wind out of place</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:30.587" end="01:36.886">Take away</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:36.886" end="01:41.157">A smell I can't go erase</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:41.157" end="01:45.046">Now it makes others days</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:45.046" end="01:48.635">I’m hopeless romantic</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:48.635" end="01:52.707">I'm lost in the moment</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:52.707" end="01:56.345">Don't know who I'm waiting</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:56.345" end="02:04.345">Cause darling I just wanted to believe</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:15.702" end="02:19.466">Passing by like you're a stranger</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:19.466" end="02:23.230">A story that will never unfold</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:23.230" end="02:25.048">Time will heal</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:25.048" end="02:27.054">Time will seal</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:27.054" end="02:30.649">All our wounds up</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:30.649" end="02:34.168">Seasons change it's getting colder</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:34.168" end="02:38.168">With you I thought I'd found forever</p></div></body></tt>